{"ID":"20240515142945-r1oatjw","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515142945-r1oatjw","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515142945-r1oatjw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143132-ckakjr2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143132-ckakjr2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:861,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143132-ckakjr2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:987,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:987\u0026#125;","title":"103","type":"doc","updated":"20240515183335"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515143132-ckakjr2","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 893px;","id":"20240515143132-ckakjr2","updated":"20240515183335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/08/18"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"YH"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"83歲　過胖"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/18"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"１帕金森氏症，近三個月發現。病後走路腰挺不直→陽虛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"２發病前，長年（十年以上）服用多種西藥、營養品，包括：　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ａbaby aspirin　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ｂ高血壓藥　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ｃ頻尿藥　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ｄ善存多種維他命　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ｅ骨骼維他命　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ｆ女性荷爾蒙　……族繁不及備載。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"３不吃高血壓藥時的血壓：150/90→此數值多是腎臟問題，血液流入腎臟，血管擴張不易，壓力回逆造成高血壓，不吃高血壓藥不會中風。若一定要吃，160/100以上才吃藥。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"４不聞香臭→此為女性荷爾蒙造成的副作用。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"１睡不好，晚上小便三次，冬天可達九次。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"２大便秘，五天以上才有，不吃藥不大便。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"３小便茶色因服維他命。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"４口渴平平，欲飲溫水。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"５胃口好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"６雙足冷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"７早起口苦、舌乾。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"８左手左足麻→有中風前兆的跡象。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"９足有點水腫，靜脈曲張→重用白芍。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"１０眠時身溫尚好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"１１很少頭痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"洪有力，不數。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下巴抖，手抖，閉眼則眼皮抖"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌黃濕"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診 : "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瞳縮反應差→腎陽不足。（瞳孔小→聰明）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝區有白點→累積毒素。（服西藥過多）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肺區有點痰。　　　　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"特殊診斷："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 腎陽不足，肝損傷，陽明腑熱。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針灸處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"１雙三皇穴→退水之外，對腳無力很有幫助。　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"２雙高血壓穴（足三里下五分往上刺到足三里）→可降血壓。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"３雙合谷　雙迎香→ 治鼻不聞香臭。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"４噴鼻粉→助痰飲排出。　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"補骨脂三錢　澤瀉六錢　川芎三錢　丹皮三錢　桃仁三錢　茯苓五錢　烏藥五錢　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"細辛二錢　白芍一兩　炙甘草五錢　炮附子三錢　辛夷三錢　厚朴二錢　枳實二錢　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大黃四錢　芒硝二錢（分三包沖服）　柴胡三錢　鬱金五錢　龍膽草三錢　酸棗仁三錢　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三付　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗煮三碗水　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前各一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解說： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"１此為典型西藥營養品造成副作用之帕金森氏症。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"２吃高血壓藥會利尿，於是得吃頻尿藥。Aspirin與維他命荷爾蒙皆無益處，更不可能預防骨質疏鬆症。故所有西藥都要停藥。不然帕金森氏症不會好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"３川芎、鉤藤、丹皮、桃仁皆可強壯血管，丹皮桃仁活血化瘀用在動脈，靜脈用白芍，服用以上中藥，即使血壓高達240也不會中風！"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"４此陽明腑熱證須先通大便解決便秘問題，之後始可著手治療帕金森氏症。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"５走路彎腰，手抖，皆為陽虛陽不足之症狀。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"６辛夷治鼻不聞香臭的嗅覺問題。烏藥、細辛引小腸火下行，促膀胱氣化，治療頻尿。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"７每天針灸鞏固療效。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}